.th DETAB I 13/7/79
.sh  NAME
detab \*- replace tabs with blanks
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd detab
[ infile [ outfile ] ]
.sh DESCRIPTION
Detab replaces all tab characters by an appropriate number of blank characters.
If no output file is specified standard output is used.
If no input file is specified standard input (and standard output) is used.
.sh "SEE ALSO"
entab (I)
.sh BUGS
